    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38180" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπαν-είρομαι</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπαν-έρομαι</span></b>  (<i><span class="en">
			Hp.
			<u>Prog.</u>
			7
		</span></i>), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>question again and
				again,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.91
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				3.32
			</span></i>: Trag. and 
				Att.
			 only in aor. 2
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπανηρόμην, τάδε σ᾽ ἐπανερόμαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					973
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηδ᾽ αὖθις ἐπανέρῃ με</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ra.</u>
					439
				</span></i>
			; <i>inquire further,</i> Hp.l.c. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>ask again,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰ ἐπανέροιτό τινά τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Prt.</u>
					329a
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Grg.</u>
				451b
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅντινα . .</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					18.6.6
				</span></i>
			.</div>
